# Uthros, Titanic Godcore's station (CR 702.184a): "Put a number of charge counters on this permanent equal to the tapped
# creature's power" reads the power as the ability resolves (ruling 2025-07-25), so Berserk cast in response, doubling
# Lake-town Mariners from 6 to 12 power, makes it twelve counters, not six. The Mariners were cast this turn: the cost taps
# a creature, not the {T} symbol (CR 107.5, 302.6), so a summoning-sick creature stations. With no counters Uthros has no
# 12+ ability (refused, with the Mox Sapphire to pay its {U} untapped); at twelve it has it (CR 721.2a), and it adds {U} for
# each of the three Moxes, the one tapped to pay included (CR 106.5).

